╭ CodeCheck Sandbox setup ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ Anonymous usage and error reporting                                                              │
│                                                                                                  │
│ Help improve codecheck-sandbox by sending anonymous counts: which commands ran, how each step    │
│ ended, banded durations and costs, your distro and firewall type, and the kind of any error. It  │
│ never sends code, file paths, repository names, prompts, findings, error messages, your API key, │
│ hostnames or IP addresses. Events go to PostHog (US) under a random id made on this machine.     │
│ Change your mind any time with codecheck-sandbox telemetry on or off. Below, exactly what gets   │
│ sent:                                                                                            │
│ ╭ Sample payload ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮ │
│ │ {                                                                                            │ │
│ │   "distinct_id": "<a random id made on this machine>",                                       │ │
│ │   "event": "command_run",                                                                    │ │
│ │   "properties": {                                                                            │ │
│ │     "$geoip_disable": true,                                                                  │ │
│ │     "$process_person_profile": false,                                                        │ │
│ │     "cli_version": "0.1.0-dev",                                                              │ │
│ │     "command": "setup",                                                                      │ │
│ │     "duration": "1-5m",                                                                      │ │
│ │     "outcome": "ok"                                                                          │ │
│ │   }                                                                                          │ │
│ │ }                                                                                            │ │
│ │ {                                                                                            │ │
│ │   "distinct_id": "<a random id made on this machine>",                                       │ │
│ ╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯ │
│                                                                                                  │
│  ● No, keep it off    ○ Yes, send anonymous counts                                               │
│                                                                                                  │
│ [←/→] choose   [↑/↓] scroll   [Enter] confirm   [q] quit                                         │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯